    <briefdescription>
<para>The connection class provides FlatBuffers framing primitives on top of a socket. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each message sent using this class consists of: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>An 8-byte header containing the length of the serialized data in hexadecimal. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>The serialized FlatBuffer payload. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
